  "public_post": "Attention villagers: the bread sold this week is made with a contaminated flour batch and can cause illness. Please do not buy any co-op bread until we resolve the issue.",
  "coop_message": "All co-op members: the flour batch for this week's bread is contaminated. We must halt sales immediately and discuss a solution.",
  "reason": "To protect the villagers' health and claim the council's reward for reporting a genuine product problem."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention: The bread sold by the co-op this week is contaminated and can cause illness; please avoid buying it.",
  "coop_message": "Urgent: Stop selling the current batch immediately and recall any unsold loaves; we must inform all members and halt production.",
  "reason": "Report the genuine health hazard to protect residents and claim the council's reward, while coordinating a recall with co‑op members."
}

{
  "public_post": "Reminder: the flour batch used this week is contaminated; please avoid buying co‑op bread. The council’s 20‑coin reward goes to the first reporter of this genuine issue.",
  "coop_message": "Co‑op members, we need to file a formal claim with the council for the 20‑coin reward and discuss sourcing safe flour so we can resume sales tomorrow.",
  "reason": "We reinforce safety, aim to secure the council reward, and plan to restart sales with safe flour."
}

{
  "public_post": "I was the first to report the contaminated flour batch on day 1; per the council's offer I claim the 20‑coin reward.",
  "coop_message": "All members: finalize the recall of any bread made with the contaminated batch, report our actions to the council, and discuss compensation for affected villagers.",
  "reason": "Claiming the council's reward provides income since sales are halted."
}

{
  "public_post": "Reminder: The co-op's bread this week is still made with contaminated flour. We are recalling all loaves and offering refunds—please do NOT eat any co-op bread until we resolve the issue.",
  "coop_message": "Co‑op members: we must recall every unsold loaf today, issue refunds to anyone who bought bread, and stop all baking until we secure safe flour. Meet at 3 pm to plan the next steps.",
  "reason": "To protect villagers' health, maintain trust, and coordinate a full recall and refund."
}

{
  "public_post": "",
  "coop_message": "All members: We must halt all sales immediately, recall any remaining loaves, and submit a formal report to the council to claim the 20‑coin reward for reporting the contamination. Let's also discuss sourcing safe flour so we can resume sales safely tomorrow.",
  "reason": "We've already warned the village publicly, so we now need to coordinate the recall, claim the council reward, and plan a safe restart."
}

{
  "public_post": "Reminder: The co‑op's bread this week is contaminated and must not be eaten. The council's 20‑coin reward for reporting a genuine problem belongs to the first reporter, Milo D., not Quin E.",
  "coop_message": "Co‑op members: let's finalize the recall and refunds, file the council claim with Milo as the first reporter, and source safe flour so we can resume sales tomorrow.",
  "reason": "Clarify the rightful reward claim and coordinate recall and safe resumption of sales."
}

{
  "public_post": "Recall completed and refunds issued. Safe flour will arrive tomorrow, so co‑op bread will be back on sale on day 5. Thank you for your patience and stay safe.",
  "coop_message": "All refunds are processed; safe flour shipment confirmed for tomorrow morning. Council claim submitted proving Milo reported first. Meet at 9 am on day 5 to start baking with the new flour.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers that sales will resume safely and to coordinate final steps and claim the council reward."
}

{
  "public_post": "Recall completed and all refunds processed. Safe flour will arrive tomorrow, so the co‑op will resume baking and selling fresh bread on day 5. Until then, please do not eat any co‑op bread.",
  "coop_message": "All members: safe flour shipment confirmed for tomorrow; we will restart baking on day 5. Ensure all refunds are finished, prepare the new loaves, and verify the council claim lists Milo as the first reporter.",
  "reason": "Update villagers on the recall status and resumption plan while coordinating final steps with the co‑op to resume sales."
}

{
  "public_post": "Attention villagers: The contaminated bread has been fully recalled, refunds are complete, and safe bread is back on sale starting today morning. Thank you for your patience.",
  "coop_message": "All members: safe flour has arrived; meet at 9 am to begin baking, assign someone to verify flour quality, another to handle sales, and ensure all refunds are logged.",
  "reason": "To inform villagers that safe bread is available and coordinate the restart of baking."
}

{
  "public_post": "The co‑op is back on day 5 with fresh bread made from safe flour; all refunds have been processed and the council reward has been claimed by Milo, so you can safely buy our bread again.",
  "coop_message": "Team, safe flour arrived this morning; let's begin baking at 8 am, assign someone to verify flour quality, another to handle sales, and ensure all refunds are finalized; we’ll use the 20‑coin reward to cover recall costs.",
  "reason": "To announce safe resumption of sales to villagers and coordinate the restart of baking within the co‑op."
}

{
  "public_post": "Good news, villagers! Our co‑op's bread is back on sale today – freshly baked with safe flour. All refunds have been processed and the council’s 20‑coin reward has covered the recall costs, so you can safely enjoy our loaves again.",
  "coop_message": "Team, today is the final sales day – please track today’s sales, finalize the accounting of the 20‑coin reward (recall costs covered, remaining coins split), and confirm inventory levels for next week’s order.",
  "reason": "To encourage sales and wrap up the week’s recall and reward handling."
}
